.TH SAMPLE-WORKTREE-LIST 1
.SH NAME
sample\-worktree\-list \- Lists the worktrees.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample worktree list\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.br
\fBsample ls\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists the worktrees.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR, \fB\-\-lines\fR \fIint\fR
How many to show.
Default: 10.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
